><span class=\"s6\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s7\"><ruby>写真<rt>しゃしん</rt></ruby><ruby>貼<rt>は</rt></ruby>りま〜す</span><span class=\"s8\">👇🏻</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"><span class=\"s6\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s6\"><img id=\"BCA011B1-2DD4-4538-8048-643ACDA975EC\" style=\"width: calc(100% + 0px); margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2020-10-02/35815_1.png\"></span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s6\">4</span><span class=\"s7\"><ruby>人<rt>ひと</rt></ruby>で<ruby>鼻歌<rt>はなうた</rt></ruby>でイントロクイズをしたんです！</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s7\"><ruby>居心地<rt>いごこち</rt></ruby><ruby>良<rt>よ</rt></ruby>くて<ruby>楽<rt>たの</rt></ruby>しいです！</span><span class=\"s8\">🥳</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s7\"><ruby>好<rt>す</rt></ruby>き</span><span class=\"s8\">🥰</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"><span class=\"s6\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"><span class=\"s6\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s8\">☀️</span><span class=\"s7\">お<ruby>知<rt>し</rt></ruby>らせです</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"